      Higashiyama, Shohei  and
      Manabe, Hiroshi  and
      Pa, Win Pa  and
      Parida, Shantipriya  and
      Bojar, Ond{\v{r}}ej  and
      Chu, Chenhui  and
      Eriguchi, Akiko  and
      Abe, Kaori  and
      Oda, Yusuke  and
      Sudoh, Katsuhito  and
      Kurohashi, Sadao  and
      Bhattacharyya, Pushpak",
    booktitle = "Proceedings of the 8th Workshop on Asian Translation (WAT2021)",
